ovement.", "then": "Use P11 or P12.", "mutatesRepo": "YES", "authority": "Repo evidence + first safe bounded mutation", "proofCeiling": "Path-grounded evidence plus actual repo movement.", "copySafeSheet": "P03_COPY_SAFE"}, {"seq": "04", "promptId": "P04", "moment": "Repo-Aware Ordered Sprint + Harness Factoring Distributor", "useItFor": "Known repo work needs harness, agent, application, integration ownership, and exact sequencing.", "doNotUseWhen": "A different prompt more directly owns the requested moment.", "produces": "Factored, ordered, non-overlapping copy-panel sprint candidates.", "gate": "Dependencies, collisions, triggers, shared owners, and panel sequence are explicit.", "then": "Use P05 or P07.", "mutatesRepo": "No", "authority": "Advisory or bounded support scope", "proofCeiling": "Dependencies and collision risks are explicit.", "copySafeSheet": "P04_COPY_SAFE"}, {"seq": "05", "promptId": "P05", "moment": "Ordered Copy-Panel Sprint Plan Pack Generator", "useItFor": "Parallel or sequential chats need one-click launch panels, explicit factoring, and a display order identical to launch order.", "doNotUseWhen": "A different prompt more directly owns the requested moment.", "produces": "Launch order at the top plus one self-contained copy panel per sprint lane.", "gate": "No monolithic prompt surface, shared-preamble assembly, or duplicate ownership.", "then": "Launch P06/P07/P08 as required.", "mutatesRepo": "No", "authority": "Advisory or bounded support scope", "proofCeiling": "Every lane has owned and forbidden scope.", "copySafeSheet": "P05_COPY_SAFE"}, {"seq": "06", "promptId": "P06", "moment": "Repo / PR Cleanup Executor", "useItFor": "The user wants cherry-picks, repairs, merges, comments, branch mutations, and PR closure.", "doNotUseWhen": "A different prompt more directly owns the requested moment.", "produces": "Preserved useful work, repaired/merged/closed PRs, clean base.", "gate": "Actual Git/GitHub mutations and disposition proof.", "then":