it Sub-Part Agent analysis, and one owned enforceable prevention change."}, {"promptType": "REVIEW + REPAIR", "promptClass": "PR / REVIEW REPAIR", "promptIds": "P14", "whenToUse": "One PR is broken or reviewed", "progressUse": "YES", "proofGate": "Exact-head repair and PR update", "fillRole": "PR repair", "fillHex": "#CFFAFE", "color": "Cyan", "meaning": "Review and repair a specific pull request at its exact head."}, {"promptType": "INTEGRATE", "promptClass": "MERGE / RELEASE", "promptIds": "P15", "whenToUse": "Ready work must land", "progressUse": "YES", "proofGate": "Merge/tag/release evidence", "fillRole": "Integration", "fillHex": "#E0E7FF", "color": "Indigo", "meaning": "Integrate, merge, tag, release, or refresh the canonical base."}, {"promptType": "INTEROP", "promptClass": "CROSS-REPO / CONTRIBUTE", "promptIds": "P16", "whenToUse": "Portable insight spans repos", "progressUse": "YES", "proofGate": "Versioned ownership-safe contribution", "fillRole": "Interop", "fillHex": "#CCFBF1", "color": "Blue-Green", "meaning": "Contribute portable insight or interoperability across repositories."}, {"promptType": "MAINTENANCE", "promptClass": "DEPENDENCY / UPGRADE", "promptIds": "P17", "whenToUse": "Upgrade packages/toolchain", "progressUse": "YES", "proofGate": "Reproducible compatibility proof", "fillRole": "Maintenance", "fillHex": "#FEF3C7", "color": "Gold", "meaning": "Upgrade dependencies or toolchains with reproducible compatibility proof."}, {"promptType": "ENABLEMENT", "promptClass": "DOCS / TUTORIAL + APP USAGE", "promptIds": "P18, P24", "whenToUse": "Create durable docs or learn the current app", "progressUse": "YES/Support", "proofGate": "Docs validate; guidance is evidence-grounded", "fillRole": "Enablement", "fillHex": "#FDE68A", "color": "Sand", "meaning": "Documentation, tutorials, and in-context app guidance tied to real behavior."}, {"promptType": "OPERATE", "promptClass": "DEPLOY / INSTALL", "promptIds": "P19", "whenToUse": "Install/deploy/upgrade ta